From: port_ios lavender
Subject: [PATCH 0709] lavender: add msm/sweetgl selectors (10-16) and heap-allocated 1024 BO slots to LavenderGPU

Expose the SweetGPU/sweetgl libdrm+msm ABI directly on LavenderGPU so Mesa
freedreno (a512) + EAGL can allocate write-combined BOs, import SweetSurface
IOSurfaces (sel 12), submit multi-IB PM4 streams via CP_INDIRECT_BUFFER
(sel 13), and query Adreno 512 parameters (sel 15).

BO metadata is heap-allocated in initWithTask() so sizeof(LavenderGPUUserClient)
stays well below XNU's 16 KiB IOUserClient static assertion limit.

